@startuml
actor User
participant "Frontend (React)" as FE
participant "Backend API (Go/Gin)" as BE
participant "Cache (Redis)" as Cache
database "Database (MongoDB / PostgreSQL)" as DB

== 🔐 Login ==
User -> FE : Enter email + password
FE -> BE : POST /api/login
BE -> DB : SELECT user by email
DB --> BE : user record
BE -> BE : verify password, generate JWT
BE --> FE : Set-Cookie (JWT, httpOnly)
FE --> User : "Welcome back!"

== 🎞️ Browse and View Movie ==
User -> FE : Open Movie List
FE -> Cache : GET movies cache
Cache --> FE : cache miss
FE -> BE : GET /api/movies
BE -> DB : Query movies
DB --> BE : List of movies
BE -> Cache : Store movies in cache
BE --> FE : JSON response (movie list)
FE --> User : Render movie cards

User -> FE : Click on movie
FE -> BE : GET /api/movie/:id
BE -> DB : SELECT movie by id
DB --> BE : movie details
BE --> FE : movie JSON
FE --> User : Show movie details page

== ⭐ Rate and Comment ==
User -> FE : Submit rating/comment
FE -> BE : POST /api/movie/:id/review {rating, comment}
BE -> DB : INSERT Review + Comment
DB --> BE : OK
BE --> FE : 201 Created
FE --> User : Update UI with new review

== 🕒 Add to Watch Later ==
User -> FE : Click "Add to Watch Later"
FE -> BE : POST /api/watchlater {movieId}
BE -> DB : UPDATE user.watchLater append(movieId)
DB --> BE : OK
BE --> FE : 200 OK
FE --> User : "Added to Watch Later"

== 🧠 Get Recommendations ==
User -> FE : Open "Recommended for You"
FE -> BE : GET /api/recommendations
BE -> DB : SELECT recent movies + user ratings
DB --> BE : user profile data
BE -> DB : SELECT movies WHERE id IN (...)
DB --> BE : Movie metadata
BE --> FE : JSON {recommendedMovies}
FE --> User : Show recommended list

== 📊 View Statistics ==
User -> FE : Open Profile
FE -> BE : GET /api/statistics
BE -> DB : SELECT stats WHERE userId = X
DB --> BE : user statistics
BE --> FE : JSON {moviesWatched, avgRating, commentsCount}
FE --> User : Render statistics dashboard
@enduml
